    "sections": {
        "description": "The Waste Management Firm Theme is a modern, eco-friendly solution designed for recycling services, garbage collection, waste disposal, sanitation services, environmental management, and residential or industrial waste management companies seeking a professional online presence. It effectively highlights sustainability initiatives, eco-friendly waste treatment solutions, renewable energy practices, and green technology, helping businesses showcase their environmental services, customer testimonials, and certifications. Fully responsive and mobile-optimized, the theme ensures seamless navigation across all devices, including desktops, tablets, and smartphones. Built with the Contact Form 7 plugin for easy inquiry and quote requests, it supports lead generation and client engagement. With customizable sections, service pages, portfolio layouts, and blog integration for publishing updates on sustainable waste practices, it boosts SEO performance and strengthens online visibility. Ideal for recycling companies, municipal waste services, waste treatment plants, landfill management, environmental consultancies, and green energy firms, this theme provides all the tools needed to build a strong digital identity, promote sustainability, and attract eco-conscious clients. Demo: https://trial.ovationthemes.com/recycling-energy/"
    },
